paragraph start
The folder tree is already the skeleton of a mind map. The root is the business plan, the areas are the first branches, the subfolders the second, and the files are the leaves.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Links between pages would add cross connections, and todo marks and tags could colour the nodes.
paragraph end

paragraph start
The box view can show more than a mind map, and how the two fit together is not decided. This page only records that the numbering keeps both options open.
paragraph end

